{"t":"CPAY","made":"2026-11-17 08:51","name":"Corpay, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":11800,"hq":"Atlanta, GA, United States","website":"https://www.corpay.com","summary_en":"Corpay, Inc. operates as a payments company that helps businesses and consumers to manage and pay their expenses.\nIt operates through Corporate Payments, Vehicle Payments, Lodging Payments, and Other segments. The company offers vehicle payment solutions for fuel, tolls and parking, vehicle compliance, auto insurance and road assistance, fleet maintenance, and long-haul transportation services, as well as prepaid food and transportation vouchers and cards. It also provides corporate payment solutions, such as cross-border payments, spend management solutions, AP modernization, virtual cards, and purchasing and T&E cards. Additionally, it offers lodging payments solutions for employees who travel overnight for work purposes; traveling crews and stranded passengers from airlines and cruise lines; workforce lodging solutions for business travel programs; airline logistics, crew management, insurance, and other payments solutions. Further, the company offers gifts and payroll cards. It serves business, merchant, consumer, and payment network customers. The company was formerly known as FLEETCOR Technologies, Inc. and changed its name to Corpay, Inc. in June 2002. Corpay, Inc. was founded in 1986 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Corpay, Inc.는 기업과 소비자가 비용을 관리하고 지불할 수 있도록 돕는 결제 회사로 운영됩니다. 기업 결제, 차량 결제, 숙박 결제 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 연료, 통행료 및 주차, 차량 규정 준수, 자동차 보험 및 도로 지원, 차량 유지 관리, 장거리 운송 서비스뿐만 아니라 선불 음식 및 교통 상품권 및 카드에 대한 차량 결제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 국경 간 결제, 지출 관리 솔루션, AP 현대화, 가상 카드, 구매 및 T&E 카드와 같은 기업 결제 솔루션도 제공합니다. 또한 업무 목적으로 밤새 여행하는 직원을 위한 숙박 결제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 항공사 및 크루즈 노선에서 여행하는 승무원 및 발이 묶인 승객; 출장 프로그램을 위한 인력 숙박 솔루션; 항공 물류, 승무원 관리, 보험 및 기타 결제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 선물과 급여 카드를 제공합니다. 기업, 판매자, 소비자 및 결제 네트워크 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 FLEETCOR Technologies, Inc.로 알려져 있었고 2002년 6월에 회사 이름을 Corpay, Inc.로 변경했습니다. Corpay, Inc.는 1986년에 설립되었으며 조지아주 애틀랜타에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":461.73,"mcap":29537712128.0,"pe":25.383728,"fpe":14.515772,"peg":0.8774,"ps":5.6477966,"pb":9.02116,"ev_ebitda":12.876,"div":0.0,"beta":0.922,"hi52":479.53,"lo52":271.22},"fin":{"rev":5229953024.0,"rev_g":0.179,"eps_g":0.448,"gross":0.80834,"op":0.49785998,"net":0.23733999,"roe":0.32209998,"fcf":1995098624.0,"cash":3123687936.0,"debt":11378806784.0,"de":310.597,"eps":18.19,"feps":31.80885},"own":{"short":0.0582,"inst":1.03151,"insider":0.04269},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":492.0,"median":481.0,"high":539.0,"low":460.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.6875,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":8,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":550.0,"priorPriceTarget":480.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":465.0,"priorPriceTarget":415.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":500.0,"priorPriceTarget":470.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Scotiabank","ToGrade":"Sector Outperform","FromGrade":"Sector Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":539.0,"priorPriceTarget":536.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPri